                "text": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Datasets minimum elements for each Data component: name, a unique identifier, a hash value, a license, a sensitivity classification, and provenance / intended use.\n\nWhere the fix goes:\n- CycloneDX: set components[].purl (or cpe, or swhid[]).\n- SPDX 2.x: add a packages[].externalRefs[] entry with referenceCategory PACKAGE-MANAGER, referenceType purl and a pkg: locator (or a SECURITY cpe23Type, or a PERSISTENT-ID swh entry).\n- SPDX 3.0: set software_packageUrl, or add an externalIdentifier[] entry with externalIdentifierType packageUrl, cpe23, swhid or swid.\n\nReferences:\n- BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Datasets / Dataset identifier (https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements)",
                "markdown": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Datasets minimum elements for each Data component: name, a unique identifier, a hash value, a license, a sensitivity classification, and provenance / intended use.\n\n**Where the fix goes**\n\n- **CycloneDX:** set components\\[\\].purl (or cpe, or swhid\\[\\]).\n- **SPDX 2.x:** add a packages\\[\\].externalRefs\\[\\] entry with referenceCategory PACKAGE-MANAGER, referenceType purl and a pkg: locator (or a SECURITY cpe23Type, or a PERSISTENT-ID swh entry).\n- **SPDX 3.0:** set software\\_packageUrl, or add an externalIdentifier\\[\\] entry with externalIdentifierType packageUrl, cpe23, swhid or swid.\n\n**References**\n\n- [BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Datasets / Dataset identifier](<https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements>)"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SBOM-BSIAI-DATASET-HASH",
              "name": "BsiSbomForAiDatasetHash",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Datasets: Dataset hash value"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Datasets: Dataset hash value. References: BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Datasets / Dataset hash value."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements",
              "help": {
                "text": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Datasets minimum elements for each Data component: name, a unique identifier, a hash value, a license, a sensitivity classification, and provenance / intended use.\n\nWhere the fix goes:\n- CycloneDX: add components[].hashes[] entries with alg SHA-256, SHA-384 or SHA-512 and the content.\n- SPDX 2.x: add packages[].checksums[] entries with algorithm SHA256, SHA384 or SHA512 and the checksumValue (PackageChecksum).\n- SPDX 3.0: add verifiedUsing[] Hash entries with algorithm sha256, sha384 or sha512 and the hashValue.\n\nReferences:\n- BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Datasets / Dataset hash value (https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements)",
                "markdown": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Datasets minimum elements for each Data component: name, a unique identifier, a hash value, a license, a sensitivity classification, and provenance / intended use.\n\n**Where the fix goes**\n\n- **CycloneDX:** add components\\[\\].hashes\\[\\] entries with alg SHA-256, SHA-384 or SHA-512 and the content.\n- **SPDX 2.x:** add packages\\[\\].checksums\\[\\] entries with algorithm SHA256, SHA384 or SHA512 and the checksumValue (PackageChecksum).\n- **SPDX 3.0:** add verifiedUsing\\[\\] Hash entries with algorithm sha256, sha384 or sha512 and the hashValue.\n\n**References**\n\n- [BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Datasets / Dataset hash value](<https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements>)"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SBOM-BSIAI-DATASET-LICENSE",
              "name": "BsiSbomForAiDatasetLicense",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Datasets: Dataset license"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Datasets: Dataset license. References: BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Datasets / Dataset license."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements",
              "help": {
                "text": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Datasets minimum elements for each Data component: name, a unique identifier, a hash value, a license, a sensitivity classification, and provenance / intended use.\n\nWhere the fix goes:\n- CycloneDX: add components[].licenses[] entries (license.id with an SPDX identifier, or an expression).\n- SPDX 2.x: set packages[].licenseDeclared (PackageLicenseDeclared) or packages[].licenseConcluded; NOASSERTION and NONE are read as absent.\n- SPDX 3.0: add a hasDeclaredLicense (or hasConcludedLicense) Relationship from the package to a simplelicensing_LicenseExpression element.\n\nReferences:\n- BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Datasets / Dataset license (https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements)",
                "markdown": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Datasets minimum elements for each Data component: name, a unique identifier, a hash value, a license, a sensitivity classification, and provenance / intended use.\n\n**Where the fix goes**\n\n- **CycloneDX:** add components\\[\\].licenses\\[\\] entries (license.id with an SPDX identifier, or an expression).\n- **SPDX 2.x:** set packages\\[\\].licenseDeclared (PackageLicenseDeclared) or packages\\[\\].licenseConcluded; NOASSERTION and NONE are read as absent.\n- **SPDX 3.0:** add a hasDeclaredLicense (or hasConcludedLicense) Relationship from the package to a simplelicensing\\_LicenseExpression element.\n\n**References**\n\n- [BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Datasets / Dataset license](<https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements>)"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SBOM-BSIAI-DATASET-SENSITIVITY",
              "name": "BsiSbomForAiDatasetSensitivity",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Datasets: Sensitivity classification"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Datasets: Sensitivity classification. References: BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Datasets / Sensitivity classification."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements",
              "help": {
                "text": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Datasets minimum elements for each Data component: name, a unique identifier, a hash value, a license, a sensitivity classification, and provenance / intended use.\n\nWhere the fix goes:\n- CycloneDX: set data[].sensitiveData[] on each data component (the first data[] entry is read).\n- SPDX 2.x: no AI or dataset profile exists in this format; use CycloneDX 1.5+ or SPDX 3.0.\n- SPDX 3.0: set dataset_confidentialityLevel on each dataset_DatasetPackage (dataset_hasSensitivePersonalInformation yes also counts).\n\nReferences:\n- BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Datasets / Sensitivity classification (https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements)",
                "markdown": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Datasets minimum elements for each Data component: name, a unique identifier, a hash value, a license, a sensitivity classification, and provenance / intended use.\n\n**Where the fix goes**\n\n- **CycloneDX:** set data\\[\\].sensitiveData\\[\\] on each data component (the first data\\[\\] entry is read).\n- **SPDX 2.x:** no AI or dataset profile exists in this format; use CycloneDX 1.5+ or SPDX 3.0.\n- **SPDX 3.0:** set dataset\\_confidentialityLevel on each dataset\\_DatasetPackage (dataset\\_hasSensitivePersonalInformation yes also counts).\n\n**References**\n\n- [BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Datasets / Sensitivity classification](<https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements>)"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SBOM-BSIAI-DATASET-PROVENANCE",
              "name": "BsiSbomForAiDatasetProvenance",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Datasets: Provenance and intended use"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Datasets: Provenance and intended use. References: BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Datasets / Provenance & intended use."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements",
              "help": {
                "text": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Datasets minimum elements for each Data component: name, a unique identifier, a hash value, a license, a sensitivity classification, and provenance / intended use.\n\nWhere the fix goes:\n- CycloneDX: name data[].governance owners, custodians or stewards (the first data[] entry is read).\n- SPDX 2.x: no AI or dataset profile exists in this format; use CycloneDX 1.5+ or SPDX 3.0.\n- SPDX 3.0: set dataset_intendedUse, dataset_dataPreprocessing or dataset_anonymizationMethodUsed, or suppliedBy / originatedBy agents, on the dataset_DatasetPackage.\n\nReferences:\n- BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Datasets / Provenance & intended use (https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements)",
                "markdown": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Datasets minimum elements for each Data component: name, a unique identifier, a hash value, a license, a sensitivity classification, and provenance / intended use.\n\n**Where the fix goes**\n\n- **CycloneDX:** name data\\[\\].governance owners, custodians or stewards (the first data\\[\\] entry is read).\n- **SPDX 2.x:** no AI or dataset profile exists in this format; use CycloneDX 1.5+ or SPDX 3.0.\n- **SPDX 3.0:** set dataset\\_intendedUse, dataset\\_dataPreprocessing or dataset\\_anonymizationMethodUsed, or suppliedBy / originatedBy agents, on the dataset\\_DatasetPackage.\n\n**References**\n\n- [BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Datasets / Provenance & intended use](<https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements>)"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SBOM-BSIAI-INFRA-RUNTIME",
              "name": "BsiSbomForAiRuntime",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Infrastructure: Runtime and framework dependency links"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Infrastructure: Runtime and framework dependency links. References: BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Infrastructure / Runtime & framework."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements",
              "help": {
                "text": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI minimum elements: document author, data-format name + version, timestamp, generation tool, and signature; the primary AI system, its producer, and its data-flow/usage; runtime/framework infrastructure links; and AI-specific security controls / exploitability references where they can be expressed.\n\nWhere the fix goes:\n- CycloneDX: add dependencies[] entries (ref plus dependsOn[]); an entry with an empty dependsOn records a component that has no dependencies.\n- SPDX 2.x: add relationships[] entries such as DEPENDS_ON (or DEPENDENCY_OF, CONTAINS) between the packages.\n- SPDX 3.0: add Relationship elements with relationshipType dependsOn (or contains) between the packages.\n\nReferences:\n- BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Infrastructure / Runtime & framework (https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements)",
                "markdown": "Declare the BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI minimum elements: document author, data-format name + version, timestamp, generation tool, and signature; the primary AI system, its producer, and its data-flow/usage; runtime/framework infrastructure links; and AI-specific security controls / exploitability references where they can be expressed.\n\n**Where the fix goes**\n\n- **CycloneDX:** add dependencies\\[\\] entries (ref plus dependsOn\\[\\]); an entry with an empty dependsOn records a component that has no dependencies.\n- **SPDX 2.x:** add relationships\\[\\] entries such as DEPENDS\\_ON (or DEPENDENCY\\_OF, CONTAINS) between the packages.\n- **SPDX 3.0:** add Relationship elements with relationshipType dependsOn (or contains) between the packages.\n\n**References**\n\n- [BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Infrastructure / Runtime & framework](<https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/software-bill-materials-ai-minimum-elements>)"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SBOM-BSIAI-SEC-CONTROLS",
              "name": "BsiSbomForAiSecurityControls",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Security: AI-specific security controls"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "BSI/G7 SBOM-for-AI Security: AI-specific security controls. References: BSI/G7 AI-SBOM: Security / AI security controls."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
